Third-party components bundled with this project:

Tabler Icons (https://github.com/tabler/tabler-icons) - MIT License.
The vendored icon path data in ui/icons/ and ui/qml/Shadcn/TablerIcons.js is
derived from Tabler Icons. Its notice is reproduced in ui/icons/LICENSE.tabler.

The component kit in ui/qml/Shadcn/ is an independent Qt/QML reimplementation
of the design language of shadcn/ui (https://github.com/shadcn-ui/ui), which is
MIT licensed. No shadcn/ui source code is included or redistributed.

Qt for Python / PySide6 (https://www.qt.io/qt-for-python) - LGPL-3.0.
The single-file Studio executable built from
packaging/EmbeddedDisplayStudio.spec bundles the PySide6 runtime and the Qt
libraries it links against. They are redistributed unmodified and used as
shared libraries under the LGPL-3.0; their own licence texts ship inside the
PySide6 distribution. No Qt source code is included in this repository, and
running from a checkout redistributes nothing -- it links against whichever
PySide6 the environment already provides.
